{"page":396,"verses":[{"verse_key":"28:85","surah":28,"ayah":85,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِى فَرَضَ عَلَيْكَ ٱلْقُرْءَانَ لَرَآدُّكَ إِلَىٰ مَعَادٍ ۚ قُل رَّبِّىٓ أَعْلَمُ مَن جَآءَ بِٱلْهُدَىٰ وَمَنْ هُوَ فِى ضَلَـٰلٍ مُّبِينٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He who has made the Quran binding on you [Prophet] will bring you back home. So say, ‘My Lord knows best who has brought true guidance and who is blatantly astray.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"28:85"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"He Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"28:85"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَرَضَ","en_gloss":"ordained","transliteration":"faraḍa","verse_key":"28:85"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"upon you","transliteration":"ʿalayka","verse_key":"28:85"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْقُرْءَانَ","en_gloss":"the Quran","transliteration":"l-qur'āna","verse_key":"28:85"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَرَآدُّكَ","en_gloss":"(will) surely take you back","transliteration":"larādduka","verse_key":"28:85"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"28:85"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَعَادٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"a place of return","transliteration":"maʿādin","verse_key":"28:85"},{"pos":9,"ar":"قُل","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"28:85"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَّبِّىٓ","en_gloss":"My Lord","transliteration":"rabbī","verse_key":"28:85"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"(is) most knowing","transliteration":"aʿlamu","verse_key":"28:85"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(of him) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"28:85"},{"pos":13,"ar":"جَآءَ","en_gloss":"comes","transliteration":"jāa","verse_key":"28:85"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِٱلْهُدَىٰ","en_gloss":"with the guidance","transliteration":"bil-hudā","verse_key":"28:85"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَمَنْ","en_gloss":"and who ","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"28:85"},{"pos":16,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"he","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"28:85"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(